<title>DENMARK: Storebaeltsforbindelsen increases DKK bond issue.</title>
<headline>Storebaeltsforbindelsen increases DKK bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Storebaeltsforbindelsen is to raise the amount of an existing four percent bond, due 2003, by 300 million crowns to 2.5 billion crowns, lead manager Unibank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A statement from the bank said that it would buy the additional bonds, effective April 4, for resale to investors at market rates.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
</text>
